            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "gayla"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I grew up eating a simplified version of this. Like Baxter5, we didn't use any spices on them other than salt and a little pepper.\n\nYou also don't need the egg, just coat and pat the crumbs on well. I prefer the flavor of the graham cracker crumbs without the egg to mess it up.\n\nVery, very yummy when prepared this way. My favorite pork chops.",
