            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "msbork"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I only baked these for 30 minutes since I was using small boneless pork chops, and they were very tender. They tasted good, a little sweet and somewhat unique, though I didn't think they were phenomenal. However, my 4-year-old son who doesn't usually like meat kept saying, \"Mmm!\" and ate every bite. That's definitely deserving of 5 stars in my mind!",
